<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Advanced CSS Styling</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #eaeaea;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        
        .box {
            width: 400px;

          
            padding: 20px;

            
            margin: 50px auto;

            
            border: 5px solid #333;

            
            background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767231186266-15c75257aaed?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D");
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;

            
            box-sizing: border-box;

            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid pink;
        }

        p {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 2px dotted white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="box">
        <h1>Advanced CSS</h1>
        <p>
            This webpage demonstrates the CSS Box Model,
            background images, borders, margins, and padding.
        </p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
